### Business Partner read/update through an SAP Integration Suite OData API artifact
###
### The caller authenticates to Integration Suite with an SAP IAS bearer token
### obtained through the established Entra ID-federated sign-in. The URL-based
### OData receiver authenticates separately to SAP with a User Credentials
### security-material alias. It fetches and forwards the backend CSRF token and
### session cookies for PATCH; this client does not handle them.
###
### Obtain the IAS token through the established Entra ID -> IAS authorization
### flow from Part 3. Run with the VS Code REST Client extension. Replace all
### placeholders and use only a designated demo BP. Never commit tokens or SAP
### credentials.

@apiBaseUrl = https://<integration-cell-virtual-host>/business-partner
@iasAccessToken = <IAS access token>
@sapClient = <target SAP client>
@businessPartner = <designated-demo-business-partner>
@newSearchTerm = MCP-DEMO

########################################################################
### 1) Read through the API artifact as the signed-in user
########################################################################

# @name listBusinessPartners
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/A_BusinessPartner?$top=5&$select=BusinessPartner,BusinessPartnerFullName,SearchTerm1&$format=json&sap-client={{sapClient}}
Authorization: Bearer {{iasAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Encoding: identity

# @name getBusinessPartnerBefore
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/A_BusinessPartner('{{businessPartner}}')?$select=BusinessPartner,BusinessPartnerFullName,SearchTerm1&$format=json&sap-client={{sapClient}}
Authorization: Bearer {{iasAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Encoding: identity

########################################################################
### 2) Update through the API artifact
###    Expected response: 204 No Content.
###    The wildcard bypasses optimistic concurrency and is suitable only for
###    this controlled PoC. Use the entity ETag instead in production.
########################################################################

# @name updateBusinessPartner
PATCH {{apiBaseUrl}}/A_BusinessPartner('{{businessPartner}}')?sap-client={{sapClient}}
Authorization: Bearer {{iasAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Encoding: identity
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: *

{
  "SearchTerm1": "{{newSearchTerm}}"
}

########################################################################
### 3) Read back and confirm SearchTerm1
########################################################################

# @name getBusinessPartnerAfter
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/A_BusinessPartner('{{businessPartner}}')?$select=BusinessPartner,BusinessPartnerFullName,SearchTerm1&$format=json&sap-client={{sapClient}}
Authorization: Bearer {{iasAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Encoding: identity
